2. What the Vulnerability Knowledge Expects

- All manipulations and accesses to the 'f' pointer (fanout group) must be properly synchronized by a mutex (mutex_lock(&fanout_mutex); ... mutex_unlock(&fanout_mutex);).
- Absence of such synchronization can lead to race conditions and UAF (use-after-free).

3. Step-by-step Code Auditing

